      "message": "Ack. I thought we could just introduce a new dependency tag then. I found it a little bit difficult to understand these \u0027smart\u0027 dependency tags. Anyway, it\u0027s a flavor and I don\u0027t think this design is wrong. So, +2\u0027ing.",
